    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> that delegates to a\n<a href=\"../Deserializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.serializer\"><code>Deserializer</code></a>\nto convert data in a byte array to an object.",
      "translation": "一个委托给 <a href=\"../Deserializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.serializer\"><code>Deserializer</code></a> 的<a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>，用于将字节数组中的数据转换为对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>DeserializingConverter</code> for using an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/ObjectInputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>ObjectInputStream</code></a>\nwith the given <code>ClassLoader</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个 `<code>DeserializingConverter</code>`，用于使用给定的 `<code>ClassLoader</code>` 与 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/ObjectInputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>ObjectInputStream</code></a>` 配合使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>DeserializingConverter</code> with default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/ObjectInputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>ObjectInputStream</code></a>\nconfiguration, using the \"latest user-defined ClassLoader\".",
      "translation": "创建一个使用“最新用户定义的 ClassLoader”配置默认 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/ObjectInputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>ObjectInputStream</code></a> 的 <code>DeserializingConverter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>DeserializingConverter</code> that delegates to the provided <a href=\"../Deserializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.serializer\"><code>Deserializer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个委托给提供的<a href=\"../Deserializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.serializer\"><code>Deserializer</code></a>的<code>DeserializingConverter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html#convert(S)\">Converter</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html#convert(S)\">Converter</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert the source object of type <code>S</code> to target type <code>T</code>.",
      "translation": "将类型为<code>S</code>的源对象转换为目标类型<code>T</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html#convert(S)\">convert</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\">Converter</a>&lt;byte[],<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "`convert` 在接口 `<a href=\"../../convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\">Converter&lt;byte[],<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</a>` 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
